vibeyard (https://github.com/elirantutia/vibeyard)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The agent terminal (milestone 03, story 02) adapts code from vibeyard, which is
licensed under the MIT License. The adapted pieces are the recipe — NOT the
package: the node-pty spawn-options block and the onData/onExit/write/resize/kill
lifecycle (win32-guarded), the CliProvider interface
(resolveBinaryPath / validatePrerequisites / buildArgs / buildEnv → pty.spawn),
and the xterm terminal-pane wiring pattern. vibeyard's Electron IPC carrier was
replaced with a WebSocket (`ws@8`) at /ws/terminal (ADR-003).

Files in this repository that carry the corresponding per-file vibeyard MIT
attribution notice:
  - src/terminal-ws.mjs
  - src/terminal-providers.mjs
  - ui/src/board/TerminalDock.tsx
  - ui/src/board/terminal/dock-state.mjs
  - ui/src/board/terminal/provider-picker.mjs
  - ui/src/board/terminal/resize.mjs

